                {
                    "type": "header",
                    "content": "The *\"Problem\"*",
                    "level": 2,
                    "positioning": {
                        "marginTop": 10
                    }
                },
                {
                    "type": "grid",
                    "columns": 2,
                    "positioning": {
                        "marginInline": 0,
                        "marginTop": 5
                    },
                    "align": "start",
                    "elements": [
                        {
                            "type": "container",
                            "flex": "col",
                            "positioning": {
                                "marginTop": 0
                            },
                            "elements": [
                                {
                                    "type": "text",
                                    "content": "In the spirit of first-world problems, one thing that has been annoying me is my accumulating collection of remotes. You don't get the most out of wireless technology when you have a remote that can only be in one place. That remote can die, break, or be lost.",
                                    "positioning": {
                                        "marginInline": 0,
                                        "marginTop": 5
                                    }
                                },
                                {
                                    "type": "text",
                                    "content": "So here's the idea: a universal remote that can record and store all your remotes. Then, using a phone, laptop, or even just voice commands, you could control your lights from anywhere.",
                                    "positioning": {
                                        "marginInline": 0,
                                        "marginTop": 5
                                    }
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "image",
                            "url": "https://assets.joshtreid.com/images/pi-controller/basic-remote.webp",
                            "title": "The \"Problem\" - Lamp remote",
                            "alt": "Image of a 433 MHz remote that controls a lamp that came with said lamp.",
                            "width": 70,
                            "aspectRatio": [1, 1],
                            "positioning": {
                                "marginTop": 0,
                                "marginInline": 10,
                                "justifySelf": "end"
                            }
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "type": "header",
                    "level": 3,
                    "size": 2,
                    "content": "Contents",
                    "positioning": {
                        "marginTop": 20
                    }
                },
                {
                    "type": "text",
                    "content": "This controller's construction can be broken into these parts:",
