                {
                    "type": "header",
                    "level": 3,
                    "size": 2,
                    "content": "PCB Layout"
                },
                {
                    "type": "text",
                    "positioning": {
                        "marginTop": 5
                    },
                    "content": "After the schematic and footprints are finished, the next step is to arrange the footprints and route traces. Luckily, this board was simple enough I didn't really have to overthink traces too much. Finally, I added holes for mounting on top of the Raspberry Pi, added some silkscreen text, and then prepared the Gerber files to send to [JLCPCB](https://jlcpcb.com/) for manufacturing."
